<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westfield America.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westfield America.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Westfield America Inc with a  market outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs was a co-underwriter of Westfield's May 15 initial public offering.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Westfield was up 1/4 to 16-3/8.</p>
</text>
